---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/LayoutWind.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Mood, Irritability & Focus in Men – His Midlife"
  description="The hormonal link between declining testosterone and low mood, irritability, and poor focus in men, and what actually helps."
>

  <section class="g-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="g-eyebrow">Guide · Mood & Mind</span>
      <h1>The irritability and flatness nobody explains</h1>
      <p>Shorter temper, less patience, a general sense of being "over it." Many men chalk this up to stress or personality, but there's often a hormonal thread underneath.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="g-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="g-label">01 / Why It Happens</span>
      <h2 class="g-title">Testosterone influences mood-regulating brain chemistry</h2>
      <p class="g-sub">Testosterone interacts with serotonin and dopamine pathways in the brain, the same systems involved in mood, motivation, and focus. When levels decline, these systems can become less balanced, independent of what's happening in your life.</p>
      <div class="g-steps">
        <div class="g-step">
          <div class="g-step-num">1</div>
          <div><h3>Lower motivation and drive</h3><p>Dopamine-linked reward pathways can feel duller, so things that used to feel exciting or worthwhile now feel flat.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="g-step">
          <div class="g-step-num">2</div>
          <div><h3>Reduced stress tolerance</h3><p>Lower testosterone is linked to a shorter fuse and less resilience to everyday frustrations, not a change in character.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="g-step">
          <div class="g-step-num">3</div>
          <div><h3>Brain fog and poor focus</h3><p>Concentration and mental sharpness can dip, often compounded by poor sleep, another common symptom.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="g-section" style="background:var(--bg-mid);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="g-cols">
        <div class="g-col">
          <h3>Signs to watch for</h3>
          <div class="sign-grid">
            <div class="sign-card">
              <span class="sign-icon">😤</span>
              <h4>Disproportionate Irritability</h4>
              <p>Irritability that feels disproportionate to the trigger.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sign-card">
              <span class="sign-icon">🎯</span>
              <h4>Lost Interest in Hobbies</h4>
              <p>Loss of interest in hobbies or things you used to enjoy.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sign-card">
              <span class="sign-icon">🧠</span>
              <h4>Trouble Focusing</h4>
              <p>Trouble focusing on tasks that used to be easy.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sign-card">
              <span class="sign-icon">🌫️</span>
              <h4>Low-Grade Flatness</h4>
              <p>A general low-grade flatness, not full sadness.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sign-card">
              <span class="sign-icon">🔗</span>
              <h4>Coincides With Other Changes</h4>
              <p>Coincides with other changes: energy, sleep, libido.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="g-col">
          <h3>What actually helps</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Regular exercise, which independently improves mood</li>
            <li>Consistent sleep, poor sleep worsens irritability sharply</li>
            <li>Talking to a doctor if low mood is persistent or severe</li>
            <li>Ruling out depression, which needs its own treatment</li>
            <li>A testosterone blood test if physical symptoms are present too</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="g-callout">
        <strong>If low mood feels severe or persistent,</strong> please speak with a doctor or mental health professional. In India, iCall (9152987821) offers free, confidential counselling support. This guide is for awareness, not a substitute for professional care.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="g-section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-num">~1-2%</span><span class="stat-label">approximate annual testosterone decline from age 30</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-num">2</span><span class="stat-label">major brain chemical pathways it interacts with: dopamine & serotonin</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-num">7-9 hrs</span><span class="stat-label">nightly sleep target, since poor sleep sharply worsens irritability</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="g-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>See how your symptoms line up</h2>
      <p>2 minutes, completely private, no login needed.</p>
      <a href="/wind/quiz" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Take the Free Symptom Check →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .g-hero { background: var(--bg-mid); padding: 4rem 0 3.5rem; }
  .g-eyebrow { display: inline-block; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft); background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: .35rem .9rem; border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .g-hero h1 { font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .g-hero p { font-size: 1.02rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 620px; }

  .g-section { padding: 4rem 0; }
  .g-label { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink); background: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: .3rem .9rem; border-radius: 99px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .g-title { font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .g-sub { font-size: .97rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 680px; }

  .g-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .9rem; }
  .g-step { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start; background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem; }
  .g-step-num { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--dark); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: .9rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .g-step h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
  .g-step p { font-size: .87rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6; }

  .g-callout { background: #fff; border-left: 4px solid var(--dark); border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .g-callout a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 700; }

  .g-cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .g-col { background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.5rem; }
  .g-col h3 { font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .85rem; }
  .g-col ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .55rem; }
  .g-col li { font-size: .87rem; color: var(--ink-soft); padding-left: 1rem; position: relative; line-height: 1.55; }
  .g-col li::before { content: '•'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--dark); font-weight: 900; }

  .g-cta { background: var(--dark); padding: 3.5rem 0; text-align: center; }
  .g-cta h2 { font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 900; color: #fff; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .g-cta p { color: #B0B0B0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .g-cta .btn-primary { background: #fff; color: #111; border-color: #fff; }
  .g-cta .btn-primary:hover { background: #E8E8E8; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) { .g-cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .sign-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .sign-card { background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem; }
  .sign-icon { font-size: 1.6rem; display: block; margin-bottom: .6rem; }
  .sign-card h4 { font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
  .sign-card p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .sign-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .stat-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .stat-item { background: var(--bg-mid); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; text-align: center; }
  .stat-num { display: block; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: .35rem; }
  .stat-label { display: block; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.4; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .stat-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
